{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.981,"lines":[{"text":"Allez, reste dans la salle, on va voyager ensemble…","t":4.06,"e":6.4,"w":[["Allez",4.06,4.22],["reste",4.28,4.54],["dans",4.58,4.64],["la",4.68,4.78],["salle",4.84,5.08],["on",5.12,5.18],["va",5.22,5.3],["voyager",5.36,5.78],["ensemble",5.82,6.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Okay, okay… laisse le Kompa rentrer dans ton cœur…","t":9,"e":13.38,"w":[["Okay",9,9.24],["okay",9.3,9.78],["laisse",11.68,11.88],["le",11.92,12],["Kompa",12.06,12.36],["rentrer",12.42,12.7],["dans",12.74,12.84],["ton",12.9,13.04],["cœur",13.12,13.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Okay, ce soir, ça devient romantique dans la salle…","t":16.72,"e":20.04,"w":[["Okay",16.72,17],["ce",18.06,18.14],["soir",18.2,18.36],["ça",18.44,18.52],["devient",18.56,18.82],["romantique",18.88,19.32],["dans",19.36,19.46],["la",19.5,19.58],["salle",19.66,20.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Thérèse, tu m’as dit quelque chose ?","t":21.56,"e":24.06,"w":[["Thérèse",21.56,22.06],["tu",22.82,22.98],["m’as",23.02,23.14],["dit",23.16,23.26],["quelque",23.3,23.58],["chose",23.64,24.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu veux un peu d’amour sur la scène ?","t":26.14,"e":27.74,"w":[["Tu",26.14,26.2],["veux",26.24,26.34],["un",26.36,26.42],["peu",26.46,26.56],["d’amour",26.6,26.98],["sur",27.04,27.16],["la",27.2,27.28],["scène",27.36,27.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans le tumulte et le bruit de ce monde cruel,","t":50,"e":53.76,"w":[["Dans",50,50.14],["le",50.18,50.3],["tumulte",50.34,51.06],["et",51.12,51.2],["le",51.26,51.34],["bruit",51.4,51.7],["de",51.76,51.86],["ce",51.92,52.12],["monde",52.3,52.76],["cruel",52.9,53.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton sourire est venu illuminer mon ciel.","t":55.6,"e":59.64,"w":[["Ton",55.6,55.72],["sourire",55.78,56.34],["est",56.38,56.64],["venu",56.7,57.34],["illuminer",57.46,58.46],["mon",58.62,58.86],["ciel",58.98,59.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es ma reine, mon phare dans la tempête,","t":60.16,"e":63,"w":[["Tu",60.16,60.32],["es",60.38,60.48],["ma",60.52,60.7],["reine",60.76,60.98],["mon",61.02,61.16],["phare",61.22,61.54],["dans",61.58,61.74],["la",61.8,62.04],["tempête",62.14,63]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Une douce mélodie qui me tourne la tête.","t":63.38,"e":66.58,"w":[["Une",63.38,63.48],["douce",63.54,63.82],["mélodie",63.88,64.68],["qui",64.74,64.86],["me",64.96,65.1],["tourne",65.28,65.58],["la",65.66,65.9],["tête",66,66.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Depuis que tes mains ont croisé mon chemin,","t":67.06,"e":69.48,"w":[["Depuis",67.06,67.34],["que",67.38,67.5],["tes",67.56,67.7],["mains",67.82,68],["ont",68.04,68.18],["croisé",68.22,68.7],["mon",68.76,68.9],["chemin",68.96,69.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je ne crains plus jamais les ombres de demain.","t":69.68,"e":72.42,"w":[["Je",69.68,69.78],["ne",69.84,69.94],["crains",69.98,70.16],["plus",70.2,70.36],["jamais",70.42,70.82],["les",70.88,71.08],["ombres",71.12,71.52],["de",71.58,71.72],["demain",71.8,72.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ta tendresse est un baume, un parfum de velours,","t":72.5,"e":75.2,"w":[["Ta",72.5,72.6],["tendresse",72.66,73.04],["est",73.08,73.24],["un",73.28,73.44],["baume",73.48,73.72],["un",73.78,73.86],["parfum",73.94,74.38],["de",74.46,74.58],["velours",74.64,75.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Qui habille ma vie d’un immense amour.","t":75.5,"e":77.94,"w":[["Qui",75.5,75.66],["habille",75.7,75.98],["ma",76.04,76.22],["vie",76.3,76.48],["d’un",76.52,76.74],["immense",76.82,77.28],["amour",77.4,77.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chaque matin près de toi est un pur miracle,","t":78.26,"e":82.12,"w":[["Chaque",78.26,78.62],["matin",78.68,79.3],["près",79.36,79.52],["de",79.58,79.7],["toi",79.86,80.1],["est",80.18,80.42],["un",80.52,80.7],["pur",80.78,81.06],["miracle",81.16,82.12]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton regard balaye le moindre de mes obstacles.","t":83.74,"e":87.74,"w":[["Ton",83.74,83.88],["regard",83.98,84.6],["balaye",84.68,85.2],["le",85.26,85.42],["moindre",85.52,86.02],["de",86.1,86.34],["mes",86.42,86.78],["obstacles",86.88,87.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as cette grâce, cette force tranquille,","t":88.16,"e":90.58,"w":[["Tu",88.16,88.32],["as",88.38,88.46],["cette",88.54,88.78],["grâce",88.82,89.14],["cette",89.22,89.48],["force",89.58,89.86],["tranquille",89.9,90.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Qui rend mon existence tellement plus facile.","t":90.82,"e":93.46,"w":[["Qui",90.82,90.94],["rend",91,91.12],["mon",91.18,91.34],["existence",91.44,92],["tellement",92.06,92.46],["plus",92.52,92.72],["facile",92.8,93.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Poésie vivante, merveille de mes jours,","t":93.8,"e":96.42,"w":[["Poésie",93.8,94.28],["vivante",94.34,94.76],["merveille",94.84,95.3],["de",95.38,95.5],["mes",95.58,95.82],["jours",95.92,96.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je veux chanter tes louanges pour toujours.","t":96.78,"e":100.44,"w":[["Je",96.78,96.92],["veux",96.96,97.1],["chanter",97.16,97.62],["tes",97.7,97.84],["louanges",97.88,98.5],["pour",98.58,98.84],["toujours",98.92,100.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans tes bras, le bonheur n’est plus un mystère,","t":100.52,"e":104.66,"w":[["Dans",100.52,100.78],["tes",100.86,101.12],["bras",101.18,101.52],["le",102.46,102.54],["bonheur",102.62,103],["n’est",103.06,103.22],["plus",103.28,103.5],["un",103.58,103.76],["mystère",103.82,104.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es mon paradis au milieu de la terre.","t":104.9,"e":117.86,"w":[["Tu",104.9,105.04],["es",105.1,105.18],["mon",105.24,105.36],["paradis",105.44,106.28],["au",108.44,108.54],["milieu",108.64,109.1],["de",109.18,109.38],["la",109.48,109.72],["terre",109.8,117.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chérie, tu es ma lumière, ma plus belle évidence,","t":133.92,"e":138.42,"w":[["Chérie",133.92,134.34],["tu",134.5,134.64],["es",134.72,134.94],["ma",135.04,135.46],["lumière",135.56,136.18],["ma",136.26,136.36],["plus",136.42,136.72],["belle",136.8,137.18],["évidence",137.28,138.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Avec toi, ma vie entière est une douce danse.","t":139.5,"e":144.06,"w":[["Avec",139.5,139.84],["toi",139.92,140.1],["ma",140.32,140.6],["vie",140.66,141.16],["entière",141.26,141.88],["est",141.92,142.08],["une",142.18,142.7],["douce",142.78,143.42],["danse",143.5,144.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"M’amour, mon ange, ma reine de chaque seconde,","t":144.34,"e":149.56,"w":[["M’amour",144.34,144.8],["mon",144.9,145.22],["ange",145.3,145.54],["ma",145.6,145.88],["reine",145.96,146.58],["de",146.82,146.94],["chaque",147.12,148.56],["seconde",148.72,149.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le plus beau trésor que je possède au monde.","t":149.62,"e":155.42,"w":[["Tu",149.62,149.76],["es",149.86,149.96],["le",150.02,150.14],["plus",150.22,150.5],["beau",150.56,151.12],["trésor",151.18,152.02],["que",152.1,152.4],["je",152.48,152.64],["possède",152.82,154.42],["au",154.46,154.6],["monde",154.78,155.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Kole tèt ou sou zepòl mwen… (colle ta tête sur mon épaule)","t":156.52,"e":157.88,"w":[["Kole",156.52,156.8],["tèt",156.88,157.06],["ou",157.08,157.16],["sou",157.22,157.4],["zepòl",157.41,157.61],["mwen",157.43,157.62],["colle",157.44,157.64],["ta",157.45,157.65],["tête",157.46,157.66],["sur",157.47,157.67],["mon",157.49,157.69],["épaule",157.5,157.88]],"ok":0.42},{"text":"Dis-moi que c’est pour la vie, pour la vie, pour la vie.","t":179.4,"e":182.26,"w":[["Dis-moi",179.4,179.68],["que",179.74,179.84],["c’est",179.92,180.06],["pour",180.1,180.24],["la",180.32,180.44],["vie",180.66,180.82],["pour",181.02,181.14],["la",181.2,181.34],["vie",181.38,181.54],["pour",181.74,181.84],["la",181.9,182.04],["vie",182.1,182.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On se balance tout doucement jusqu’au bout de la nuit,","t":182.44,"e":185.2,"w":[["On",182.44,182.52],["se",182.58,182.74],["balance",182.78,183.1],["tout",183.16,183.28],["doucement",183.34,183.8],["jusqu’au",183.86,184.16],["bout",184.22,184.34],["de",184.4,184.52],["la",184.6,184.74],["nuit",184.94,185.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Nos deux cœurs en harmonie sur ce Kompa qui nous suit.","t":185.3,"e":189.34,"w":[["Nos",185.3,185.42],["deux",185.46,185.58],["cœurs",185.64,185.82],["en",185.88,185.96],["harmonie",186.02,186.62],["sur",187.38,187.52],["ce",187.56,187.74],["Kompa",187.8,188.26],["qui",188.32,188.6],["nous",188.66,188.86],["suit",188.98,189.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as guéri mes blessures et toutes mes failles,","t":191.32,"e":195.2,"w":[["Tu",191.32,191.62],["as",191.72,191.94],["guéri",192.06,192.52],["mes",192.58,192.86],["blessures",192.92,193.48],["et",193.54,193.74],["toutes",193.84,194.1],["mes",194.2,194.44],["failles",194.58,195.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À tes côtés, plus rien d’autre ne vaut la maille.","t":196.98,"e":200.86,"w":[["À",196.98,196.98],["tes",197.04,197.3],["côtés",197.4,198],["plus",198.28,198.46],["rien",198.54,198.76],["d’autre",198.82,199.1],["ne",199.18,199.44],["vaut",199.52,199.78],["la",199.88,200.08],["maille",200.24,200.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Épouse parfaite, complice de mes nuits,","t":201.2,"e":203.7,"w":[["Épouse",201.2,201.6],["parfaite",201.66,202.26],["complice",202.34,202.82],["de",202.88,203.02],["mes",203.08,203.36],["nuits",203.44,203.7]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le soleil qui efface la pluie.","t":203.96,"e":206.58,"w":[["Tu",203.96,204.12],["es",204.2,204.28],["le",204.34,204.42],["soleil",204.5,204.96],["qui",205.02,205.2],["efface",205.34,205.86],["la",205.94,206.18],["pluie",206.28,206.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans le creux de tes reins, je trouve ma patrie,","t":206.82,"e":209.46,"w":[["Dans",206.82,206.96],["le",207,207.1],["creux",207.14,207.3],["de",207.36,207.46],["tes",207.52,207.66],["reins",207.74,207.98],["je",208.06,208.16],["trouve",208.24,208.52],["ma",208.58,208.72],["patrie",208.8,209.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton amour est l’encre dont ma vie est écrite.","t":209.66,"e":212.4,"w":[["Ton",209.66,209.84],["amour",209.94,210.2],["est",210.22,210.34],["l’encre",210.4,210.68],["dont",210.72,210.86],["ma",210.92,211.06],["vie",211.14,211.42],["est",211.48,211.64],["écrite",211.88,212.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je t’offre mon âme, mon respect, ma fidélité,","t":212.54,"e":217.66,"w":[["Je",212.54,212.64],["t’offre",212.7,213.04],["mon",213.1,213.42],["âme",213.54,213.7],["mon",213.8,214.08],["respect",214.16,214.94],["ma",215.04,215.22],["fidélité",215.38,217.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pour naviguer ensemble vers l’éternité.","t":218.22,"e":223.34,"w":[["Pour",218.22,218.36],["naviguer",218.44,219.6],["ensemble",219.92,220.74],["vers",220.76,221],["l’éternité",221.06,223.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chérie, tu es ma lumière, ma plus belle évidence,","t":224.74,"e":229.22,"w":[["Chérie",224.74,225.22],["tu",225.34,225.48],["es",225.58,225.8],["ma",225.9,226.34],["lumière",226.42,227.04],["ma",227.12,227.24],["plus",227.3,227.6],["belle",227.68,228.04],["évidence",228.24,229.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Avec toi, ma vie entière est une douce danse.","t":230.38,"e":234.92,"w":[["Avec",230.38,230.74],["toi",230.82,231.04],["ma",231.22,231.5],["vie",231.56,232.06],["entière",232.18,232.8],["est",232.84,233.02],["une",233.12,233.64],["douce",233.72,234.34],["danse",234.44,234.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"M’amour, mon ange, ma reine de chaque seconde,","t":235.12,"e":240.56,"w":[["M’amour",235.12,235.76],["mon",235.86,236.2],["ange",236.26,236.48],["ma",236.56,236.84],["reine",236.94,237.58],["de",237.78,237.92],["chaque",238.08,239.54],["seconde",239.72,240.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le plus beau trésor que je possède au monde.","t":240.64,"e":246.48,"w":[["Tu",240.64,240.78],["es",240.86,240.96],["le",241,241.12],["plus",241.18,241.48],["beau",241.56,242.12],["trésor",242.2,243.06],["que",243.14,243.42],["je",243.5,243.64],["possède",243.84,244.86],["au",245.48,245.7],["monde",245.82,246.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Sens le rythme du Kompa qui doucement nous enlace,","t":270.34,"e":274.94,"w":[["Sens",270.34,270.68],["le",270.76,270.86],["rythme",270.94,271.38],["du",271.44,271.58],["Kompa",271.66,272.28],["qui",272.66,272.82],["doucement",272.88,273.74],["nous",273.8,274.06],["enlace",274.12,274.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Regarde-moi dans les yeux, et le temps perd toute sa trace.","t":275.9,"e":280.82,"w":[["Regarde-moi",275.9,276.88],["dans",276.96,277.12],["les",277.18,277.46],["yeux",277.58,277.9],["et",278.42,278.52],["le",278.56,278.68],["temps",278.78,279.2],["perd",279.28,279.56],["toute",279.64,279.88],["sa",279.96,280.12],["trace",280.18,280.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Rien n’est plus fort que ce que ton amour m’apporte,","t":281.94,"e":286.32,"w":[["Rien",281.94,282.12],["n’est",282.16,282.28],["plus",282.34,282.56],["fort",282.66,283.14],["que",283.2,283.36],["ce",283.48,283.66],["que",283.74,283.9],["ton",284.46,284.62],["amour",284.74,285.32],["m’apporte",285.38,286.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je t’aime, je t’aime, et j’ouvre à ton cœur toutes les portes.","t":286.78,"e":291.92,"w":[["Je",286.78,287.04],["t’aime",287.12,287.62],["je",288.24,288.48],["t’aime",288.56,289.08],["et",289.5,289.58],["j’ouvre",289.62,289.94],["à",290.04,290.1],["ton",290.16,290.32],["cœur",290.4,290.68],["toutes",290.76,291.04],["les",291.1,291.32],["portes",291.44,291.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chérie, tu es ma lumière, ma plus belle évidence, (ouh oui…)","t":293.16,"e":298.38,"w":[["Chérie",293.16,293.64],["tu",293.76,293.92],["es",294,294.16],["ma",294.32,294.78],["lumière",294.86,295.48],["ma",295.56,295.66],["plus",295.74,296.02],["belle",296.1,296.46],["évidence",296.58,297.62],["ouh",297.68,297.88],["oui",297.74,298.38]],"ok":0.91},{"text":"Avec toi, ma vie entière est une douce danse. (une douce danse)","t":298.7,"e":304.82,"w":[["Avec",298.7,299.2],["toi",299.28,299.54],["ma",299.68,299.96],["vie",300.04,300.54],["entière",300.62,301.26],["est",301.3,301.44],["une",301.56,302.1],["douce",302.18,302.5],["danse",302.92,303.36],["une",303.54,303.7],["douce",303.78,304.42],["danse",304.5,304.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"M’amour, mon ange, ma reine de chaque seconde,","t":305.2,"e":308.92,"w":[["M’amour",305.2,305.84],["mon",305.92,306.16],["ange",306.24,306.58],["ma",306.64,306.76],["reine",306.84,307.1],["de",307.18,307.3],["chaque",307.46,307.88],["seconde",308.24,308.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le plus beau trésor que je possède au monde.","t":309.1,"e":314.92,"w":[["Tu",309.1,309.28],["es",309.34,309.44],["le",309.5,309.62],["plus",309.68,309.98],["beau",310.06,310.62],["trésor",310.7,311.54],["que",311.62,311.92],["je",312,312.14],["possède",312.36,313.36],["au",314,314.1],["monde",314.32,314.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Nos voix s’unissent, nos âmes dansent en cadence,","t":315.2,"e":319.48,"w":[["Nos",315.2,315.34],["voix",315.4,315.64],["s’unissent",315.72,316.38],["nos",316.46,316.82],["âmes",316.9,317.44],["dansent",317.54,318.08],["en",318.2,318.52],["cadence",318.6,319.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton nom résonne en moi comme une douce transe.","t":321.28,"e":325.36,"w":[["Ton",321.28,321.42],["nom",321.48,321.6],["résonne",321.66,322.2],["en",322.3,322.46],["moi",322.54,322.82],["comme",323.06,323.26],["une",323.54,323.72],["douce",323.8,324.3],["transe",324.66,325.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu m’apportes le bonheur…","t":325.9,"e":327.62,"w":[["Tu",325.9,326.04],["m’apportes",326.1,326.66],["le",326.7,326.8],["bonheur",326.9,327.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chérie doudou…","t":329.44,"e":330.93,"w":[["Chérie",329.44,329.86],["doudou",330.73,330.93]],"ok":0.5},{"text":"Pour toujours, toi et moi, sous la lune qui balance.","t":331.6,"e":337.02,"w":[["Pour",331.6,331.6],["toujours",331.6,332.16],["toi",332.72,332.94],["et",332.98,333.08],["moi",333.16,333.4],["sous",334.16,334.32],["la",334.38,334.5],["lune",334.58,335.18],["qui",335.26,335.72],["balance",335.8,337.02]],"ok":1.0}]}